patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101501.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-01T23:14:18Z"},"body":"In `InputEventMouseMotion`, the documentations for `velocity` and `screen_velocity` used to state about their usage with the `Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED` mode.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d79ff848fa599df0665977623581fe55f558eaee/doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml#L34-L36\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d79ff848fa599df0665977623581fe55f558eaee/doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml#L40-L43\r\n\r\nBoth `velocity` and `screen_velocity` return `(0, 0)` in the `Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED` mode, which conflicts with the past statement of them being able to be used for mouse aiming.\r\n\r\nFixes #97599\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101501/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101501/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"s